📋 Leave Request Submitted - Awaiting Approval
=====
<h2>Hello {{#with requester}}{{this.full_name}}{{/with}},</h2>

<div class="info-box info-box-success">
  <h3 style="margin-top: 0; color: #059669;">✅ Request Submitted Successfully</h3>
  <p>Your leave request has been sent to <strong>{{#with approver }}{{this.full_name}}{{/with}}</strong> for review.</p>
</div>

<div class="content-card">
  <div class="content-card-header">
    <h3 style="margin: 0; color: #1f2937;">📅 Leave Request Details</h3>
  </div>
  <div class="content-card-body">
    <p><strong>{{>leave_request_detail leave=leave }}</strong></p>
    {{> email/leave_comments comments=comments }}
  </div>
</div>

<div class="info-box">
  <h3 style="margin-top: 0; color: #1f2937;">⏳ What Happens Next?</h3>
  <p>Your supervisor will review your request and you'll receive another email once a decision is made.</p>
  <p>You can check the status of your request anytime by logging into {{> email/link href=(get_application_domain)
    text='TimeOff.Management' }}.</p>
</div>

<p style="margin-top: 20px;">Best regards,<br><strong>The TimeOff.Management Team</strong></p>